<view class="page" data-b="B301"><dev-badge wx:if="{{developerMode}}" code="B301" /><view class="hero" data-b="B305"><dev-badge wx:if="{{developerMode}}" code="B305" /><view class="pill">时间售卖 · {{version}} · 本地演示</view><view class="title">把经验，留给需要的人</view><view class="subtitle">先管理自己的时间，再决定哪些时段愿意开放。</view></view><view data-b="B303"><dev-badge wx:if="{{developerMode}}" code="B303" /><scroll-view scroll-x class="category-scroll"><view class="categories"><text wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="*this" class="category {{category === item ? 'on' : ''}}" data-category="{{item}}" data-z="Z303-1" bindtap="chooseCategory">{{item}}</text></view></scroll-view></view><view class="row section-row"><text class="section-title">发现服务</text><text class="small muted">含本机发布与示例</text></view><view wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="id" class="card listing" data-b="B304" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-z="Z304-1" bindtap="openDetail"><dev-badge wx:if="{{developerMode}}" code="B304" /><view class="row"><view class="avatar {{item.tone}}">{{item.avatar}}</view><view class="listing-main"><view class="listing-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{item.host}}</view></view><view class="price">¥{{item.price}}</view></view><view class="description">{{item.description}}</view><view class="row"><text class="pill">{{item.category}}</text><text class="small muted">{{item.duration}} 分钟 · {{item.mode}}</text></view></view><view class="notice bottom-note">本机发布只在这台设备可见；跨用户发布、预约及付款待服务端接入。</view></view>
